<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Participer - {{ defi.titre }} | Midgar</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/midgar.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --accent: #18E3A4;
            --muted: #B0B9B6;
            --bg-dark: #0B0F0E;
            --bg-darker: #080A0A;
            --border: #2A3139;
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0B0F0E 0%, #1A1F1E 100%);
            color: #E6FFF6;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        header {
            background: rgba(26, 31, 30, 0.95);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .header-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .logo { order: 2; margin-left: 1rem; }
        nav { order: 1; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap: 1rem; }
        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        nav a {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .btn {
            padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #16D49A;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--muted);
            border: 2px solid var(--muted);
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
        main {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }
        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }
        .defi-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A1F1E 0%, #252A29 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .defi-card h2 {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .defi-card .theme {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.15);
            color: var(--accent);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .defi-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .form-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A1F1E 0%, #252A29 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .form-card h3 {
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            background: var(--bg-darker);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #E6FFF6;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .form-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.2);
        }
        .form-input::placeholder { color: #5a6562; }
        textarea.form-input { resize: vertical; min-height: 120px; }
        .form-errors {
            color: #e57373;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
        }
        .form-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        .form-actions .btn { min-width: 140px; }
        .flash-success {
            background: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.15);
            color: var(--accent);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .flash-error {
            background: rgba(229, 115, 115, 0.15);
            color: #e57373;
            border: 1px solid #e57373;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">Midgar</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/challenges">Défis</a>
                <a href="/">Accueil</a>
            </nav>
            <a href="/challenges" class="btn btn-secondary">Retour aux défis</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <a href="{{ path('challenges_index') }}" class="back-link">← Retour aux défis</a>

        {% for message in app.flashes('success') %}
            <div class="flash-success">{{ message }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for message in app.flashes('error') %}
            <div class="flash-error">{{ message }}</div>
        {% endfor %}

        <div class="defi-card">
            {% if defi.imageCover %}
                <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;">
                    <img src="{{ vich_uploader_asset(defi, 'imageCoverFile') }}" alt="{{ defi.titre }}" style="width: 100%; max-height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <h2>{{ defi.titre }}</h2>
            <span class="theme">{{ defi.theme }}</span>
            <p>{{ defi.description }}</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">📅 Du {{ defi.dateDebut|date('d/m/Y') }} au {{ defi.dateFin|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="form-card">
            <h3>Participer à ce défi</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">Indiquez l'ID d'une œuvre déjà en ligne ou <a href="{{ path('challenges_peindre', {'id': defi.id}) }}">peignez une œuvre</a> dans l'éditeur.</p>
            {{ form_start(form, { 'attr': { 'class': 'participation-form', 'enctype': 'multipart/form-data' } }) }}
                <div class="form-group">
                    {{ form_label(form.description) }}
                    {{ form_widget(form.description) }}
                    {{ form_errors(form.description) }}
                </div>
                <div style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
                    <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.95rem;">Vous avez deux options :</p>
                    <ul style="color:var(--muted); margin-left:1rem; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                        <li>Utiliser une œuvre déjà en ligne en indiquant son ID ci-dessous.</li>
                        <li>Ou <strong>peindre une nouvelle œuvre</strong> dans l'éditeur en ligne.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="{{ path('challenges_peindre', {'id': defi.id}) }}" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-right:1rem;">Peindre une œuvre</a>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    {{ form_label(form.artworkId) }}
                    {{ form_widget(form.artworkId) }}
                    {{ form_errors(form.artworkId) }}
                </div>
                <div class="form-actions">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Envoyer ma participation</button>
                    <a href="{{ path('challenges_index') }}" class="btn btn-secondary">Annuler</a>
                </div>
            {{ form_end(form) }}
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
